 afterSeq accepted. Permanent FAIL report/probes retained under spec/progress/evidence/LOOP1-GO-MSG-001/2026-10-01-independent-review-f1764fd/.\n\nNEW Fix changes only two production files and three regressions. Preserve prior committed/inflight origin marker through rejected retry; required afterSeq is presence-sensitive and valid0 remains valid. Actual production-chain delayed/duplicate routing and missing/null negatives FAIL before/PASS after. Full actual migratedPG16/NATS2.10 normal/race PASS20.188s/82.094s, zero runtime skips; structural/build/vet/format PASS, four preexisting Windows symlink subcase skips require hostedLinux checks. Scoped Recorder97events/all100raw files byte-identical; owned services removed.\n\nNEW independent rereview and exact repaired-head hostedCI pending. Old greenCI never substitutes. Draft unmerged, Taskreview unfinished, S1OPEN; no selfacceptance. Friend403 exception unrelated to message authorization. Evidence2026-10-01-fix-handoff.md and fix-command-results.json under Taskevidence.","created_at":"2026-10-01T04:46:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T05:35:15Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4fb552a0412d0b970f930181fed0ae299a4a92d8","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/4/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/4/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/issues/4/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nilesthump/IM-platform/statuses/33b1522c7f315b7aeb25fc31c05756c2bc950a9c","head":{"label":"nilesthump:task/LOOP1-GO-MSG-001","ref":"task/LOOP1-GO-MSG-001","sha":"33b1522c7f315b7aeb25fc31c05756c2bc950a9c","user":{"login":"nilesthump","id":211787881,"node_id":"U_kgDODJ-gaQ","avatar_url":"